  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5201.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5201.01 Purpose. It is the purpose of this chapter to provide for the reimbursement of all reasonable and necessary costs for response, incident assessment, control, containment, and abatement of the immediate hazard as a direct result of an actual or threatened hazardous material or waste incident all to better protect the public health, safety, and welfare as provided in RSA 154:8-a.\n\nSource. #7511, eff 6-23-01, EXPIRED: 6-23-09\n\nNew. #12614-A, eff 8-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5200.html"
}
